  "notes": [
    "Cenário do capítulo 04: luta na pista ao entardecer, avião atrás e escada no embarque.",
    "PNG masters and prompts retained, with one ImageGen call per distinct asset/six-frame sheet.",
    "Ground marks and lettering are editable code-native graphics, distinct from painted masters.",
    "FUGA rules, damage, stairsX and stairsRange are unchanged. Decorative props have no new collisions.",
    "Plane and stairs share factor1; source anchor registration is explicit in this exporter. Nose intentionally extends beyond right world boundary as in the existing airport staging.",
    "Staff, windsock and beacon use six independently drawn poses; reusable community NPCs follow the tour.",
    "No automatic airplane takeoff or arrest animation is claimed; victory narration remains in story.",
    "Original audio synthesis and measurements: audio/manifest.json."
  ]
}